          <p class="pt-3">Our work represents the range of residential and commercial construction projects completed by S. Phaneuf & Associates throughout Massachusetts. Every project has different requirements, from working with existing grades and drainage to selecting materials that complement the property and designing spaces around how they will be used.</p>
